---
description: Git commits are authored only by the repo owner
alwaysApply: true
---

Never add a `Co-authored-by` trailer. Commits are authored only by the repo owner.

If a wrapper injects a trailer, strip it with git plumbing (`git commit-tree` + `git update-ref`). Do not use `git commit --amend` to strip it; that path can put the trailer back.
